SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Easy aerobic run of 60–70 min at 6:30
 –6:50/km\, HR ≤138 bpm. 
DESCRIPTION:Easy aerobic run of 60–70 min at 6:30–6:50/km\, HR ≤138 b
 pm. Stop immediately if HR drifts upward without pace change (cardiac drif
 t = still not recovered). No distance target.\n\nReason: Athlete reported 
 illness on 15 Aug and has logged virtually no training in 4 weeks\; jumpin
 g straight into a 180-min long run risks setback — a short easy run is b
 oth safer and diagnostically useful for gauging recovery state.\n\nAI coac
 hing 2026-08-22
END:VEVENT
