SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — Shorten to 50–55 min at 110–140W (low
 er Z2 only)\; stop if HR
DESCRIPTION:Shorten to 50–55 min at 110–140W (lower Z2 only)\; stop if 
 HR exceeds 145 bpm at these watts. Do not attempt the full 90-min block th
 is week.\n\nReason: Following illness and near-zero training load for 4 we
 eks\, a 90-min Z2 ride mid-week is too large a jump — 50 min at controll
 ed intensity keeps the aerobic stimulus without overloading a system still
  rebuilding.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-22
END:VEVENT
