SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] swimming — Retain as the anchor session of the week
 . Aim for 3\,000–3\,50
DESCRIPTION:Retain as the anchor session of the week. Aim for 3\,000–3\,5
 00m total with 2×750m continuous swims at 2:25–2:30/100m as the core se
 t\, surrounded by easy warm-up/cool-down. If fatigue is high on the day\, 
 reduce continuous efforts to 2×500m but keep total time at 75 min.\n\nRea
 son: With 42 days to the Half Oceanman 5000m swim and almost no training l
 ogged\, this session is the single highest-leverage fitness opportunity th
 is week and must be protected — framing it around continuous 750m blocks
  builds race-specific endurance most efficiently.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-2
 2
END:VEVENT
