SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — Keep as 60 min easy at 110–130W. Skip t
 he AI-added evening o
DESCRIPTION:Keep as 60 min easy at 110–130W. Skip the AI-added evening op
 en-water swim on this day — doing swim + bike on the same day is appropr
 iate only once weekly volume is re-established. Focus Saturday on the ride
  only.\n\nReason: The AI-added 60-min evening swim creates a double-sessio
 n day that is premature given the athlete is still in early recovery from 
 illness\; the Friday race-simulation swim is the swim priority this weeken
 d.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-22
