SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Cap at 90 min easy at 6:30–6:50/km (app
 roximately 12–13km). 
DESCRIPTION:Cap at 90 min easy at 6:30–6:50/km (approximately 12–13km).
  Negative-split approach only if feeling genuinely strong in the final 20 
 min. Rebuild long run length by ~15 min per week from here.\n\nReason: A 1
 9km long run the week after returning from illness (with a curtailed long 
 run the previous Sunday) would represent a >100% single-week load jump —
  90 min is a meaningful stimulus while keeping injury risk low.\n\nAI coac
 hing 2026-08-22
END:VEVENT
