SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — Reduce to 150–180 min (approximately 65
 –75km) at 128–160W\; i
DESCRIPTION:Reduce to 150–180 min (approximately 65–75km) at 128–160W
 \; include 2×10 min at 170–177W in the middle if the first hour feels c
 ontrolled. This is a stepping-stone week\, not yet a full peak long ride.\
 n\nReason: Jumping from near-zero training to a 4-hour long ride in week 1
 1 after illness is high injury/fatigue risk\; a 2.5–3 hour controlled ri
 de preserves the aerobic stimulus while allowing the body to re-adapt prog
 ressively.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-22
